WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.472
- So I'm gonna walk around
the streets of Hollywood

00:00:02.472 --> 00:00:06.389
and ask people if they
want to eat a raw onion.

00:00:10.258 --> 00:00:12.150
What do you guys think about onions?

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:13.608
- I love onions.

00:00:13.608 --> 00:00:14.550
- Pretty good.

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:16.498
- I like onions, Jake hates onions.

00:00:16.498 --> 00:00:18.239
- I love em, use em all the time.

00:00:18.239 --> 00:00:21.328
Red, organic, quite sweet, great.

00:00:21.328 --> 00:00:22.327
- They make me cry.

00:00:22.327 --> 00:00:23.886
- I like em grilled.

00:00:23.886 --> 00:00:24.847
- They got layers.

00:00:24.847 --> 00:00:26.981
- They're really good on cheeseburgers.

00:00:26.981 --> 00:00:28.455
- I think onions are okay.

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:30.147
Sautéed I don't like em raw.

00:00:30.147 --> 00:00:31.580
- Do you like onions raw?

00:00:31.593 --> 00:00:32.426
- Actually yes.

00:00:32.426 --> 00:00:33.259
- Sometimes.

00:00:33.259 --> 00:00:34.092
- Uh, no.

00:00:34.092 --> 00:00:34.925
- Not at all?
- No.

00:00:34.925 --> 00:00:35.841
Not at all.
- Yeah.

00:00:35.841 --> 00:00:36.674
- No.
- They make you cry

00:00:36.674 --> 00:00:37.637
when you cut em.

00:00:37.637 --> 00:00:38.470
- No.

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:39.749
- Absolutely. (laughing)

00:00:39.749 --> 00:00:40.689
- Do you want to eat a raw onion?

00:00:40.689 --> 00:00:42.397
- For how much?

00:00:42.397 --> 00:00:43.230
- Nothin.

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:44.291
All I can offer you is the onion.

00:00:44.291 --> 00:00:45.576
- For free?

00:00:45.576 --> 00:00:47.039
I'm not that high.

00:00:47.039 --> 00:00:48.379
- You can take an extra onion with you.

00:00:48.379 --> 00:00:49.357
- I would consider it.

00:00:49.357 --> 00:00:51.662
If I was hungry enough, I
definitely would do that.

00:00:51.662 --> 00:00:54.401
- Would you consider it right now?

00:00:54.401 --> 00:00:55.476
- Hmm, no.

00:00:55.476 --> 00:00:56.451
Probably not right now.

00:00:56.451 --> 00:00:58.731
- Would you eat an entire raw onion?

00:00:58.731 --> 00:00:59.564
- No.

00:00:59.564 --> 00:01:00.706
- Too much.

00:01:00.706 --> 00:01:01.917
- No, you sure?

00:01:01.917 --> 00:01:02.750
- It's too much.

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:04.181
- Are you gonna do that for this video?

00:01:04.181 --> 00:01:05.014
- No.

00:01:05.014 --> 00:01:06.119
- Okay.
- Would you?

00:01:06.119 --> 00:01:07.071
- I wouldn't.

00:01:07.071 --> 00:01:08.089
- I probably, I might.

00:01:08.089 --> 00:01:11.260
- Would you consider eating
the entire raw onion on camera?

00:01:11.260 --> 00:01:12.201
- Yes I would.

00:01:12.201 --> 00:01:13.573
- Sure, why not.

00:01:13.573 --> 00:01:14.417
- Okay.

00:01:14.417 --> 00:01:15.443
Here we go.

00:01:15.443 --> 00:01:16.304
(laughing)

00:01:16.304 --> 00:01:17.725
- You have one in your backpack?

00:01:17.725 --> 00:01:18.558
- I sure do.

00:01:18.558 --> 00:01:20.532
- I won't eat it, but I'll hold the peel.

00:01:20.532 --> 00:01:21.514
- Here's your sweet onion.

00:01:21.514 --> 00:01:22.645
Have at it.

00:01:22.645 --> 00:01:24.774
(crunching)

00:01:24.774 --> 00:01:29.648
- He just walks around with
an onion in his backpack.

00:01:29.648 --> 00:01:31.373
(crunching)

00:01:31.373 --> 00:01:33.206
- This is pretty good.

00:01:34.753 --> 00:01:37.208
- That's a decent bite of an onion.

00:01:37.208 --> 00:01:38.588
Don't breathe on me.

00:01:38.588 --> 00:01:40.679
- Do you want anymore of this?

00:01:40.679 --> 00:01:41.512
(crunching)

00:01:41.512 --> 00:01:42.345
- It's delicious dude.

00:01:42.345 --> 00:01:44.194
- Regretting your decision?

00:01:44.194 --> 00:01:45.027
- No.

00:01:45.027 --> 00:01:47.920
- I'm regretting her decision. (laughing)

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:49.399
- This is actually kinda, kinda good.

00:01:49.399 --> 00:01:51.649
(laughing)

00:01:56.134 --> 00:01:58.450
- What's that onion doing to you?

00:01:58.450 --> 00:01:59.301
- That's it?

00:01:59.301 --> 00:02:00.134
- That's it.

00:02:00.134 --> 00:02:00.967
- Are you crying?

00:02:00.967 --> 00:02:02.831
She's tearing up already.

00:02:02.831 --> 00:02:03.664
- So beautiful.

00:02:03.664 --> 00:02:04.711
That is all I can do.

00:02:04.711 --> 00:02:06.911
I am very glad that I stepped
out of my comfort zone today.

00:02:06.911 --> 00:02:10.770
- Could you ever see
yourself doin that again?

00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:12.090
- No.

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:12.923
Well I am.

00:02:14.099 --> 00:02:14.932
I don't know.

00:02:14.932 --> 00:02:17.104
Nobody, nobody ever asked
me to eat an onion before.

00:02:17.104 --> 00:02:18.853
- Was it better or
worse than you expected?

00:02:18.853 --> 00:02:20.987
- It was actually a little bit better.

00:02:20.987 --> 00:02:22.424
Because I was expecting
to maybe only take,

00:02:22.424 --> 00:02:24.364
be able to take one or two
bites before I wimped out,

00:02:24.364 --> 00:02:27.310
but I am very proud of myself,
I ate half an onion today.

00:02:27.310 --> 00:02:28.684
- Well folks, we did it.

00:02:28.684 --> 00:02:31.063
We got people to take
a bite of a raw onion.

00:02:31.063 --> 00:02:33.396
(crunching)

00:02:37.097 --> 00:02:38.919
- The real news is too ridiculous.

00:02:38.919 --> 00:02:40.701
You make people eat
onions, what are you doin?

